        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Barbara Feldon, Don Adams\n- Roles: Agent 99, Maxwell Smart\n- Works: Get Smart, Get Smart, Again!\n\nFacts:\n- Barbara Feldon was born on March 12, 1933, and she is an American character actress who has worked mostly in theatre.\n- Barbara Feldon is primarily known for her television roles.\n- In the 1960s sitcom Get Smart, Barbara Feldon played Agent 99, which was her most prominent role.\n- In Get Smart, Again!, Don Adams and Barbara Feldon reprised their characters of Maxwell Smart and Agent 99.",
